  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:120%; font-size:9pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold"&gt;GLOSSARY OF TERMS&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:120%; font-size:9pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:120%; font-size:9pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The following abbreviations and acronyms may be used in these financial statements to identify American Transmission Systems, Incorporated and its current and former affiliated companies:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:120%; font-size:9pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:468pt; border-collapse:collapse"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;tr&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:97.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;AGC&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:349.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Allegheny Generating Company, a wholly owned generation subsidiary of MP&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;tr&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:97.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;ATSI&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:349.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;American Transmission Systems, Incorporated, a wholly owned transmission subsidiary of FET&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;tr&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:97.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Brookfield&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:349.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;North American Transmission Company II L.P., a controlled investment vehicle entity of Brookfield Super-Core Infrastructure Partners&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;tr&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:97.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Brookfield Guarantors&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:349.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Brookfield Super-Core Infrastructure Partners L.P., Brookfield Super-Core Infrastructure Partners (NUS) L.P., and Brookfield Super-Core Infrastructure Partners (ER) SCSp&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;tr&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;td style="width:97.2pt; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:top"&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
							&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;CEI&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
						&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
